# Origin of the VaNi API on the VPS. The browser calls it directly —
# vani.vikuna.io and api.vikuna.io are same-site, so the SameSite=Strict
# refresh cookie still works, and nginx keeps seeing the real browser origin.
#
# Requires on the VPS side: an SSL cert on api.vikuna.io, and vani.vikuna.io
# added to the `map $http_origin` allowlist in api.vikuna.io.conf.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=https://api.vikuna.io
